          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "KLEOS RD CRONO\n\nUnleashing creative potential with a bold, dynamic design\nto emphasize theperformance of a top-tier road wheel.\n\nThe KLEOS RD CRONO is a high-performance\nroad wheel with a striking, bold design.\n\nThis project gave us the freedom to explore\ncreative possibilities, and we took a maximalist\napproach to make the most of its visual impact.\n\nThe large “K” in the Kleos logo was key\nin conveying the sensation of rotation, creating\na dynamic, energetic effect. This design perfectly\ncaptures the wheel’s performance-driven nature\nand its cutting-edge identity.",
